<title>POLAND: WEDEL 96 NET RISES TO PLN 40.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL 96 NET RISES TO PLN 40.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.42 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.50 vs   2.12 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.00 vs   3.06 loss</p>
